<section class="home-section">
    <h2 class="home-section-title">Demarrage rapide ingestion</h2>
    <p class="home-section-lead">
        Endpoint principal: <strong>POST /api/logs</strong>.
        Envoyer un payload JSON avec header <strong>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</strong>.
    </p>

    <pre class="home-code">curl -X POST "{{ app.request.schemeAndHttpHost }}/api/logs" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN" \
  -d '{"logs":[{"message":"Erreur checkout","level":"error","domain":"billing"}]}'</pre>

    <p class="home-note">
        Astuce: en cas d'erreur API, la plateforme renvoie une reponse JSON.
        En navigation web, une page d'erreur HTML dediee est affichee.
    </p>
</section>
